      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932114697265799645",
      "text": "[5:31PM] #Agege #PenCinema #TrafficUpdate \n\n Good movement from the Fumec area inwards Acme. This flow continues steadily down to Metal Box. Along Oba Akran, traffic from the Dangote U-turn towards Mobil Ashade and further down to Akilo is proceeding at a fast pace. \n\nSimilarly, Ijaye Road, both inwards and outwards at the Odo Eran intersection, is experiencing a fast pace of movement. The flow on Guinness Road inwards towards Akanni Doherty is also fast-paced, with a minor delay noted at the Mangoro Ashade intersection due to alternation. \n\nOn Capitol Road, the movement inwards from Aoniwaya junction down to Alfa Nla is reported as steady. Olkekoto Road, travelling inwards through Shofunde, Agbotikuyo, Olufunlayo, and down to NYSC, is moving at a fast pace.\n\n Lastly, on Old Abeokuta Road, traffic from Isokoko towards Total underneath the bridge is slow-moving due to traffic alternation.  However, approaching Oko Oba and continuing down to the Abbatoir area, the traffic flow is fast-paced.\n\n There are no impediments reported at this time, and our men are present and addressing any necessary situations at key locations. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
