      "text": "[6:53PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Oyebanji Roundabout, connecting to Adeniji Adele Road, through Oba's Palace and Police Post.\nExpected traffic flow from underneath Idumota Bridge, inward journey to Eyin Eyo, connecting Balogun and Martin Street, with no cause for concern.\nSmooth traffic conditions from Tinubu Square, connecting to Nnamdi Azikiwe Street, en route Tom Jones Intersection.\nEfficient movement on Illubinrin ascending Carter Bridge, inward journey to Ijora Olopa, as well as Oyingbo.\n\nAt present, no impediments have been reported, and traffic officers remain highly visible, actively managing and controlling traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
